    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s04-t01-mother-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s04-t01-mother-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（20联考）三个自然数成等差数列，公差为20，其和为4095。这三个数中最大的是：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "1345"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "1365"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1385"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "1405"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          42
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          36
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s04-t01-mother-01-p042.webp",
            "alt": "等差数列与和定最值 · 母题精讲1 · 讲义第36页",
            "pdfPage": 42
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s04-t01-mother-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s04-t01-mother-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看三个数成等差数列，总和4095。三个数的平均数就是中间那个数，所以中间数＝4095÷3＝1365。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "公差是20，最大数就在中间数上加20，得到1385。三个数1345、1365、1385相加确实为4095，所以选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "奇数项等差数列先找中间项，最大项再按公差向后推。"
        }
      ],
